xcelium/riscv_test/innovus_chip_quad/smoke_run.log
# Keepers: re-include human-authored setup the global rules had dropped
# (*.sh/*.v/*.vhd/*.txt already survive the xcelium whitelist above; these four
# do not, so re-include them explicitly — they win over *.sdf* / *.rcf globals):
!xcelium/riscv_test/innovus_chip/*.py
!xcelium/riscv_test/innovus_chip/*.rcf
